    "detailed_description": "PonGlow is a fast paced survival arcade game where you compete against the world and your friends in a bid to achieve the best score. PonGlow has a randomised level generator so you will never get the same game twice. What score can you get?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Different themes from Egyptian Pharaohs to candy galore<br />\r\n-Collect health and shields to last longer.<br />\r\n-Randomised level generator.<br />\r\n-Progressive difficulty.<br />\r\n-Stat tracking to let you know how many blocks you hit and more.<br />\r\n-Fast paced action from start to finish.<br />\r\n-Unlock new blocks and more from levelling up.<br />\r\n-Compete with your friends and the world to achieve the best score.<br />\r\n-Over 100 unique blocks",
